  data: {
    LLM: "Race for the first Marianna. Since it sets the trump, being the first to declare is a massive advantage. If you have a King and Knight, declare it immediately, even if it's your first card.\n\nThe Trump Switch: If your opponents declared the first Marianna (setting trumps to Hearts), and you have a Marianna in Diamonds, wait until they've led their high Hearts before you declare YOUR Marianna. This switches the trump suit and renders their high Hearts useless.\n\nDraw-Deck Management: Since you draw a card after every trick, you have 5-10 draws to complete a Marianna. If you have only a King, keep it! The probability of drawing its Knight is about 1 in 8 for each draw.",
    Player: "Race for the first Marianna. Since it sets the trump, being the first to declare is a massive advantage. If you have a King and Knight, declare it immediately, even if it's your first card.\n\nThe Trump Switch: If your opponents declared the first Marianna (setting trumps to Hearts), and you have a Marianna in Diamonds, wait until they've led their high Hearts before you declare YOUR Marianna. This switches the trump suit and renders their high Hearts useless.\n\nDraw-Deck Management: Since you draw a card after every trick, you have 5-10 draws to complete a Marianna. If you have only a King, keep it! The probability of drawing its Knight is about 1 in 8 for each draw.",
